r through supervoting stock. They incorporated Google as a privately held company on September 4, 1998. An initial public offering (IPO) took place on August 19, 2004, and Google moved to its new headquarters in Mountain View, California, nicknamed the Googleplex. In August 2015, Google announced plans to reorganize its various interests as a conglomerate called Alphabet Inc. Google, Alphabet's leading subsidiary, will continue to be the umbrella company for Alphabet's Internet interests. Upon completion of the restructure, Sundar Pichai was appointed CEO of Google; he replaced Larry Page, who became CEO of Alphabet.\n\nQuestion: Who is the founder of google and when was it founded?", "references": ["1998", "Larry Page and Sergey Brin", "Larry Page", "Sergey Brin", "1998 by Larry Page and Sergey Brin"]}, {"input": "Passage: Prehistoric technology is technology that predates recorded history. History is the study of the past using written records. Anything prior to the first written accounts of history is prehistoric, including earlier technologies. About 2.5 million years before writing was developed, technology began with the earliest hominids who used stone tools, which they may have used to start fires, hunt, and bury their dead.\n\nQuestion: How did early humans make use of stones during the prehistoric period?", "references": ["start fires", "hunt", "bury their dead", "to start fires, hunt, and bury their dead"]}, {"input": "Passage: \nDefinition of the problems and/or goals;\nIdentification of alternative plans/policies;\nEvaluation of alternative plans/policies;\nImplementation of plans/policies;\nMonitoring of effects of plans/policies.\n\n\nQuestion: The basic steps of rational decision making include defining goals and?", "references": ["Identification of alternative plans/policies", "Evaluation of alternative plans/policies", "Implementation of plans/policies", "Monitoring of effects of plans/policies"]}, {"input": "Passage: The Bob & Tom Show is a syndic