Day box office ever with $14.75 million in ticket sales.[2] The film was followed by a 2011 direct-to-video prequel, Marley & Me: The Puppy Years.\n\nQuestion: Is it marley and me or marley and i?", "references": ["Marley & Me"]}, {"input": "Passage: World Teachers' Day, also known as International Teachers Day, is held annually on October 5. Established in 1994, it commemorates the signing of the 1966 \"Teaching in Freedom\". \"Empowering Teachers” is the theme of this year's (2017) World Teachers' Day, celebrated around the world since 1994 after the UNESCO/ILO Recommendation concerning the Status of Teachers.[1]\n\n\nQuestion: Who inaugurated 'world teachers' day'?", "references": ["UNESCO", "ILO"]}, {"input": "Passage: The United States Oath of Allegiance, officially referred to as the \"Oath of Allegiance,\" 8 C.F.R. Part 337 (2008), is an allegiance oath that must be taken by all immigrants who wish to become United States citizens.\n\nQuestion: What is the oath that new citizens take?", "references": ["United States Oath of Allegiance", "The United States Oath of Allegiance, officially referred to as the \"Oath of Allegiance,\""]}, {"input": "Passage: 1.SURFACE AREA OF ROOTS IS ENORMOUS. it is a common experience that even a small Garden plants such as balsam when generally uprooted from the soil shows a thick bunch of rootlets(branch roots).\n\nQuestion: Active absorption of water from the soil by the root is mainly affected by?", "references": ["ATP", "SURFACE AREA OF ROOTS"]}, {"input": "Passage: Thomas \"Tom\" Hagen is a fictional character in Mario Puzo's novel Godfather and Francis Ford Coppola's films The Godfather and The Godfather Part II. He is portrayed by Robert Duvall in the films.[1]\n\nQuestion: Who played tom hagon in the godfather series?", "references": ["Robert Duvall"]}, {"input": "Passage: \n\nMum\n\n\nGenre\nSitcom\n\n\nCreated by\nStefan Golaszewski\n\n\nWritten by\nStefan Golaszewski\n\n\nDirected by\nRichard Laxton\nStefan Golaszewski